The '''Whirlpool''' is an area that is used to access the [[Underwater City]].

==Appearance==
The Whirlpool consists of a large whirlpool surrounded by rocks. The rocks have small amounts of grass on them, and a dock for [[boats]].

==Location==
The Whirlpool can be found in the open ocean close to [[Frozen Village]] in the [[First Sea]] to access [[Underwater City]].

